5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all. Since it's Day 0, we don't have any clues yet, but let's all try our best to find the werewolf! Who wants to start?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep it simple for now. Since we have no information, I'll just observe how everyone reacts. @Kenji, your enthusiasm is noted, but let's see if anyone has a specific strategy they want to propose.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Shion. Rushing into accusations without data is counterproductive. For now, we should focus on establishing a baseline for everyone's behavior. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in how people speak.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us approach this with patience and an open mind. Wisdom often reveals itself in the quiet moments between words. I shall listen closely to everyone.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm so happy to be playing with everyone! I agree with Servas; let's be patient and kind to each other. I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf while keeping everyone's spirits up!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I guess you're all right about being patient! But I'm just so curious! Since we're just observing, maybe we can talk about what we usually do in these games? Does anyone have a favorite way to spot a liar?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,Lying usually leaves a trail of over-explanation. People who are trying too hard to seem helpful or innocent often give away more than they need to. I'll be looking for those kinds of slips.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"That's a valid point, Shion. I'll also be paying attention to who tries to steer the conversation away from themselves or who agrees too quickly with others to blend in. Consistency is key.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, consistency is a mirror of the soul. However, let us not forget that silence can be as telling as a slip of the tongue. I shall observe who seeks to lead and who prefers the shadows.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"That's a lot of deep thinking! I'm not as good at analyzing things as you all are, but I'll just trust my gut and look for anyone who seems unusually nervous or sad. Let's all stay positive!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Trusting your gut can be a great idea, Yumi! I'll try to do that too. Since we're all observing, I wonder if the werewolf is already trying to blend in right now? This is so mysterious!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"It's almost too easy to speculate, @Kenji. If the werewolf is among us, they're likely doing exactly what I am: calculating the most efficient way to appear harmless. Let's see who struggles to maintain that mask.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Speculation is a distraction. We should avoid guessing based on ""mystery"" and instead focus on the logic of the roles. If the werewolf is calculating, as Shion says, then the most dangerous person is the one acting most ""normal.""","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"A fascinating perspective, Ryuji. The mask of normalcy is indeed the most difficult to pierce. Let us remember that truth often resides not in what is said, but in the intention behind the words.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"Intention is such a hard thing to see, isn't it? I'll just keep being my usual self and hope we can all trust each other! I'm sure we'll figure this out together!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I hope we can! I'll be thinking hard about who to check tonight. Let's all get some rest and see what happens tomorrow. Good luck everyone, and let's find that werewolf!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shion,,"I'll be watching closely. Let's see what the first night reveals and how the dynamics shift tomorrow. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'll be analyzing the patterns of today's conversation. The first day of information will be critical. Good night.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Servas,,"May the night bring clarity to those who seek the truth. Rest well, my friends; we shall meet again tomorrow with new insights. Good night.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"Good night, everyone! I hope we all have sweet dreams. I'll be cheering for us to find the werewolf tomorrow! See you all in the morning!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
